  "_doc": [
    "Le Bac à sable magique: the element table and the reaction table.",
    "scripts/sandbox-wasm.mjs turns this file into rust/sandbox-core/src/gen.rs and src/games2d/sandbox/wasm/ids.ts.",
    "Element ids and reaction ids are saved on children's devices: never renumber or rename them, only append.",
    "kind: solid | powder | liquid | gas | special. density orders what sinks in what (water = 50).",
    "rate: chance out of 255 to move each tick. slide: chance out of 255 to slip down a slope (0 = holds its shape).",
    "spread: how far a liquid levels sideways per tick. paint: how full a brush stroke is, in percent.",
    "hot / cold: [temperature, becomes, reaction] phase changes on the temperature plane (0-255, 128 = a mild day).",
    "heat: warmth the element gives off every tick. Pair rules: a + b -> outA + outB with a chance out of 1000 per tick."
  ],
